Description: unofficial Pop COSMIC experience for GNOME Shell 48
 An unofficial, modernized suite for GNOME Shell 48 containing the pop-cosmic,
 cosmic-workspaces, and pop-shell extensions, Pop Launcher, a standalone
 Python/Libadwaita settings application, and the Pop GTK and icon themes.
 .
 This project is independent, is not affiliated with or endorsed by System76,
 and uses the Pop and COSMIC names only to describe compatibility and origin.
